  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Three o'clock, 20 meters, caster target A."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eight o'clock, 30 meters, commander behind the heavies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enemy sniper at ten o'clock. Heads down."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "05:32 P.M. \\ Clear\nLungmen Harbor - Rhodes Island Warship - Lower Deck Firing Range"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "This is only the fifth round."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "And you're already slowing down on your targets, and not even hitting vitals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "In a real combat situation the enemy could've even shot back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "What's wrong, Jessica? Is this training exercise too hard for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Ah, er, phew... N- no!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Let's keep going!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "You have the right attitude, but you need more strength behind it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Let's take ten. Catch your breath."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I want to go over handgun basics with you one more time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "You can't neglect your fundamentals. Not even for a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "First is balance and posture. No matter what kind of environment you're moving through, you can't let yourself go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Keep your upper body low, protect your core."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Then, keep the Originium Arts you're using to control the gun nice and stable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Feel the connection between your arm and the gun's interior. Reach out to the ammunition feeding into the chamber, then activate it and let it fly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "It's easier said than done. You have to meticulously engage your Originium Arts to trigger it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "If you lose control of your Arts, the gun could misfire. You could even damage it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Last, line up your target, aim, fire, and move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "These are the absolute basic basics of Blacksteel firearms theory. You should be well acquainted with them, Jessica."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Now, do you know the biggest mistake you made with your shooting just now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Um... I haven't trained enough, so I wasn't moving my center of gravity fast enough, and then I didn't control my Originium Arts very well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "And... I hesitated too much before firing, flinching and missing my targets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Aaaahh! When I say it out loud, I messed up everything I did!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "You're half right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Jessica, you're trying to do everything all at once. You want to be fast, and you want to hit all your targets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "You find yourself worrying about every little thing. You end up getting spooked by your own tail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "And because you're so panicked, you're losing control of your Originium Arts. Then, when you start aiming at the enemy, you have to be running control tests inside your weapon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "That's why you have so much trouble shooting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Th- that's what's happening...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "The first thing you have to do is clear your mind of all those things you worry so much about, and just focus on your fingertips."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Trust your partner. The gun in your hand won't betray you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "The way you treat it, that's how it'll respond to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "The speed and volume of your Arts aren't important. Just focus on maintaining precise control and stability."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Come on, let's go. I want to see you move past those three windows and hit as many targets as you can as fast as you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Go five rounds! Focus on your Originium Arts!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Got it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Fundamentals, fundamentals, fundamentals. It's been three hours..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Get me out of this sweaty training room."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "It's just a scouting mission in some ruins, an easy little thing for Jessica to take care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You think she'll run into a big baddie out for a stroll?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "What I think she needs to train most of all is her confidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Looking at Blacksteel files, Jessica's stats are all completely middle-of-the-pack."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "And it's not like she's not under pressure, with this special mission attached to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "She's going out with Frostleaf and Meteorite and they'll take care of her. But making sure she's prepared can't hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "It's gonna hurt when she passes out from exhaustion in the ruins out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "She came looking for me to train up her combat ability. She's worried she'll be a burden."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Right after the Lungmen cleanup, we're heading back to Blacksteel HQ. We don't have much time to train Jessica."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I'm trying to share as much of my experience as possible, especially with firearms."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You take such good care of your little girl. It's sweet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Who knew you remembered we had to go back to Blacksteel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "We'll report on the Lungmen situation, but we also have the usual tests to go through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You're not preparing at all? Not worried about your numbers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I've already prepared everything we need to give to the company. It's not like I've been goofing off every night at Rhodes Island"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Hehe, how did you know I've just been goofing off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You really look after your teammates, Liskarm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "And as for my scores, if they drop too much and I get transferred, at least I won't have to deal with you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Judging by what you've been doing with Jessica, I guess the idea is just to pile on the training so she gains experience?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "I just see her grinding away over and over and over again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "I mean if you're just having a little firearms seminar, why not go get those sparkly angels?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "They're the real gun masters, right? Bang! Pow! I bet they'd straighten Jessica out. A lot better than learning from you, anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "If you go ask them, all you'll get is, 'What is there to study? There is nothing simpler.' 'Why not just feel it out?' Answers like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "To those angels, who walk around with multiple heavy weapons, a handgun like this is little more than a toy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Laterano firearms practices are insanely advanced and complicated. She couldn't learn anything from them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Heh. Makes you kind of envious, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Getting a handle on the fine control of Originium Arts under a wide variety of potential circumstances is no easy feat, and doesn't come with a typical training regimen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Why do the Blacksteel bosses even want their people using such nasty weapons?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "It's a long-range weapon that's harder to use than a crossbow, with more expensive ammunition, and more finicky maintenance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "The pistol is a logical enough choice for Blacksteel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Standardized weapons make management easier for the company, reduce turnover, and screen out mediocrity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Plus they have a guaranteed rate of fire and are easier to conceal than other ranged weapons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "All right, all right. I get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You just keep at it. I'm gonna head home, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "I'm cheering Jessica on in spirit. I need to rest up some more before we go back to HQ."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I didn't call you here for my health. Jessica needs your help too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I can't teach her frontline assault and high speed maneuvers at the same time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Just teach her to carry a big shield and move around while shocking people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Be serious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Your experience is worth a lot more to Jessica than my advice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Moving back and forth around the front lines, breaking through the enemy's defenses, maintaining Originium Arts to power weapons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Nobody in Blacksteel has the kind of control over Originium Arts that you do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Stop stop stop already. How is it this kind of stuff just flows out of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You're embarrassing me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Anyway, it's not that I'm against teaching Jessica. I just have no idea how to be a teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "What if she can't follow me? What if she can't keep up? I don't know if I can slow down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "That's fine. That's how Jessica would want it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Have you actually looked at Jessica's numbers, the ones you just gave me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, is something wrong? How bad are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's been working so hard..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Actually take a look, dumbass."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She doesn't top Blacksteel's charts, but in absolute terms she's not much worse than us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We know Jessica could stand to be more confident, but these aren't a stupid kid's scores."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's trained long and hard, and she's committed to not letting us down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I had no idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just make sure you don't teach Jessica to be a dumbass like you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
